THIRD-PARTY CODE SHIPPED IN THIS REPOSITORY
-------------------------------------------

1. Patches to SGLang — deploy/images/sglang/*.patch
   They modify files of SGLang (Copyright 2023-2024 SGLang Team, Apache License 2.0), applied at image
   build time on top of the lmsysorg/sglang image pinned by digest in that Dockerfile. The modified
   files, the Apache-2.0 text and the change notice: deploy/images/sglang/NOTICE.

2. Patches to TensorFold and to vLLM — deploy/images/tensorfold/*.patch,
   deploy/images/vllm/priority/, deploy/images/vllm/glm53/,
   deploy/images/vllm/deepseek-v4-b12x/ (where present)
   Each image directory carries its own NOTICE naming the upstream project, its license and the
   change made; the patches are applied at image build time. Two directories also ship a whole
   modified upstream vLLM file (Apache-2.0, "Copyright contributors to the vLLM project", its SPDX
   header kept): deploy/images/vllm/glm53/sparse_attn_indexer_kpool_sm121.py and
   deploy/images/vllm/deepseek-v4-b12x/quant_config.py; their NOTICE files name the origin and the
   change.

3. lb/fleet_telemetry — the box-side hardware sender
   Its sampler, LAN broadcast and hardware readers began as broker_parrot's hardware telemetry (hw_metrics,
   hw_lan, hw_watch, cgroup attribution; github.com/robertziel/broker_parrot, Apache-2.0, by the same author),
   copied into this repository and rewritten here. It is this repository's own code, under this repository's
   license; nothing of that project is imported or tracked.

4. Fonts of the panel's styles — lb/vllm_lb/static/styles/fonts/
   Inter (Copyright 2020 The Inter Project Authors, github.com/rsms/inter) at weights 400 / 500 / 600 and
   Fragment Mono (Copyright 2022 The Fragment-Mono Project Authors, github.com/weiweihuanghuang/fragment-mono)
   at 400, for the "Clean" style and, where the system offers no UI face of its own, the "Glass" style; JetBrains Mono (Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors,
   github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono) at 400 / 500 / 600 / 700, for the "Mono" and "Terminal" styles. Each is subset and served
   as woff2 by the gateway itself (the panel fetches nothing from a CDN). All under the SIL Open Font License
   1.1; the full texts sit beside the fonts: Inter-OFL.txt, FragmentMono-OFL.txt, JetBrainsMono-OFL.txt.

THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE USED BUT NOT SHIPPED
-----------------------------------------

The Docker images this repository builds pull vLLM, SGLang, TensorFold, SearXNG, nginx, frp and the
Python base image at build time, each under its own license; none of their source is in this
repository. The optional broker (broker_parrot, github.com/robertziel/broker_parrot, Apache-2.0) is
mounted from a separate checkout and is never vendored here.
